{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"erlang","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"Erlang","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Erlang (.erl .hrl .escript).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"erlang","name":"Erlang","extensions":[".erl",".hrl",".escript"],"grammar":"grammars/erlang.json","lineComment":"%"}],"snippets":[{"language":"Erlang","path":"snippets/erlang.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/erlang.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"match\": \"%.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"-[a-z]+(?=\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\?[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"->|<-|=>|\\\\|\\\\|\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:andalso|receive|orelse|after|begin|catch|band|bnot|bxor|case|cond|when|and|bor|bsl|bsr|div|end|fun|let|not|rem|try|xor|if|of|or)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:undefined|false|error|true|ok)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:lists:filter|lists:foldl|setelement|io:format|lists:map|register|element|length|spawn|apply|self|send|hd|tl)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_]*\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/erlang.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Module\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"mod\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"-module(${1:name}).\",\n      \"-export([${2:main/0}]).\",\n      \"\",\n      \"$0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A module header\"\n  },\n  \"Function\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fn\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:name}(${2:Args}) ->\",\n      \"    $0.\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A function\"\n  },\n  \"Case\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"case\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"case ${1:Expr} of\",\n      \"    ${2:Pattern} -> $0\",\n      \"end\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"case\"\n  },\n  \"Receive\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"recv\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"receive\",\n      \"    ${1:Pattern} -> $0\",\n      \"end\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"receive\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Erlang\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Erlang.\n\n## Files\n\n`.erl`, `.hrl`, `.escript`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `%`.\n- 4 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `mod` | A module header |\n| `fn` | A function |\n| `case` | case |\n| `recv` | receive |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}